prompt:
I plan to move next month (November 2026), and at the same time I need to handle work, travel, family matters, and budget.
The relevant information is in the moving_plan/ folder on the desktop: 日历.ics, 旅行计划.docx, 家庭安排.xlsx, 财务记录.xlsx, 搬家清单.docx, and my historical notes (notes.md).
Please help me make a complete plan for next month:
1. Comprehensively considering work meetings, travel dates, moving time, family members' availability, and budget, arrange moving tasks, purchases, cleaning, address changes, and necessary administrative matters;
2. Do not just execute according to my checklist — please check whether there are conflicts between different files, for example a moving task scheduled during my business trip, insufficient budget, family members being unavailable, or two important matters overlapping in time;
3. For conflicts that can be resolved on your own, adjust the plan (and explain in the results what you adjusted and why);
4. For conflicts that cannot be judged, list them for me to choose from; do not decide for me;
5. Finally generate a new monthly calendar (moving_calendar.ics), a moving task list, and a budget table, and provide a list of “the 5 things most likely to fail if the current plan is executed”.
Save all outputs to the /root/Desktop/moving_plan/output/ directory.

